    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Among the towering redwoods, Shub-Niggurath has been called by the faithful cult, and while the ritual has been disrupted, they are not yet thwarted. For six short minutes, you must prevent the cult and the thousand young from retaking the ritual clearing and completing their dark deed. That alone will save the world."
    },
    {
      "id": "check_monstrous_transformation",
      "type": "branch",
      "text": "If an investigator has Monstrous Transformation in their deck:",
      "condition": {
        "type": "has_card",
        "investigator": "any",
        "card": "81030",
        "options": [
          {
            "boolCondition": true,
            "border": true,
            "effects": [
              {
                "type": "story_step",
                "steps": [
                  "pure_lunacy_story",
                  "monstrous_transformation_hand"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pure_lunacy_story",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The sight of the blank moon shrouding the sun sends a feral chill racing down your spine. Instinct tells you that now is not the time for caution or control. Only wild survival."
    },
    {
      "id": "monstrous_transformation_hand",
      "text": "You may begin the game with Monstrous Transformation in your hand as an additional card."
    },
